氏就又吼了起来：“娘，你看这小凡都活蹦乱跳的了，哪里还需要钱治病了，你叫大嫂先还我们一些呗。”孟氏在一旁附和着：“是啊，娘，二嫂说的对。”叶氏满眼怒气的瞪过去：“你们哪只眼睛看到我们凡儿活蹦乱跳了，瞧那小脸苍白的，就那么点儿救命的银子你们都想讨去。”孟氏见状，也不生气，似早已经习惯了叶氏的怒气，语带讥讽的说：“小凡都被张家退亲了，日后怕是没有人会娶她了，大哥也真够倒霉的，娶了那么个贴钱媳妇儿，还生了个赔钱的丫头，不知道大嫂肚子里怀的会不会又是一个赔钱货。”“你……你们给我滚。”叶氏怒急，操起一旁的扫把，作势就要赶人。“你把钱给我们，我们就走，谁愿意大老远的跑来你们这破破烂烂的地方啊。”李氏吃定了这老太婆不敢真的打自己，站在原地动也未动分毫，还一脸嫌弃的四下扫了一圈，继续说道：“都不知道你们怎么住下去的，这风大些都能吹榻的破屋子，也就你们能住这么些年。”“作孽啊，二夫，三夫这是上辈子造了什么孽，才会娶了你们这样恶毒的媳妇儿。”叶氏握着手中的扫帚，气的发抖。“娘，您可真是老糊涂了，这当年还是让媒婆上我们家来提亲的呀。”孟氏捂嘴乐了，人说年纪大了，就会忘事，还真有那么回事儿。“诶……”叶氏捶胸顿足，懊悔不已，要不是当年娶了这样两个媳妇进门，一夫跟芷烟小两口的日子又怎会过到此般地步。贾氏见状走了过去，扶住她，满脸担忧：“娘，别气坏了身子。”而后略带责备的看了一眼二人，道：“两位弟妹，说话也要注意下分寸才是，娘上了年纪，身子本就不好。”孟氏扬扬细眉，大声反驳道：“若是大嫂爽快些将钱拿出来，我们还用在这闹吗？”“怎么回事儿，这半天也不见你们回去？”随着一声粗壮的嗓音，不远处的小道上，不急不缓的走来了一堆人。苏小凡抬眼看过去，来人是她二叔、三叔，还有二叔家的两个儿子，三叔家的一儿一女。见到来人，苏小凡不自觉的皱了皱眉，按记忆中来看，这些人也不算什么好人。“孩他爹，你来了，你看，这娘跟大嫂死活不肯将银子还出来。”孟氏见自己男人来了，在他们踏进院子那一刻，就抬脚迎了上去。“娘，这就是您老不对了，先前借钱的时候都说好的吧。”苏三夫走进院子后，埋怨的看了一眼年迈的老娘，又看了看立在门口的苏小凡，继续说：“嫂子，你看小凡这不都好好的醒过来了。”“三弟，不是我跟娘不给，着实是张家给的碎银子本就不多，这几日来凡儿抓药去掉了一些，今日娘又去买了些大米玉米面什么的，已经没剩下银子了。”贾氏面露难色，从前这些上门讨债的都是一夫出面应付的，从未让自己处理过，而一夫死后，那些债主看她们这孤儿寡女的日子不好过，甚少上门讨要，而频繁上门的就只有这二弟跟三弟家的人了。这时，一直站在苏三夫身后的一个瘦弱的少年，站了出来，大声嚷嚷着：“爹，娘，我看将她们买的东西直接拿走好了，看去也是讨要不到银子了今天。”然后苏二夫身后的一个少年也站了出来，说：“四庆说得对。”“那就这么办吧。”苏二夫低低的说了一句，粗犷的嗓音中掺杂着几许不悦。他的话音落下，两个少年，就走进了一个小偏房中，将叶氏今早去买回来的那一袋东西都拎了出来。“你们不能这样，那可是这个家里唯一的粮食啊。”叶氏急的都快哭了，要是没有了那些吃的，凡儿这孩子如何能好起来，再者芷烟这眼看着就要临盆了。“娘，您别无理取闹，这欠债还钱，是天经地义的事。”苏二夫沉声瞪向自己的老娘，似乎她此刻的模样给他丢了脸一般的嫌恶。“老天啊，我这是造了什么孽啊。”叶氏瘫倒在地，悲从中来，满是皱纹的老脸上，尽是泪痕。“娘，娘，您别这样。”贾氏挺着圆鼓鼓的肚子，艰难的跪了下去，想要将叶氏扶起来。苏小凡淡然的看着这一切，忽然深深的了解了平日里人们口中所说的那所谓的极品亲戚是什么样的人，即便是陌生人，做事也不会这般的狠。然后，平静的走进了厨房，扫了一眼后，见厨房内就一口破旧的铁锅，为数不多的一些柴火，还有几个不完好的碗跟筷子，再无别的东西，哦，还有一个破菜板跟菜刀。苏小凡想也没多想，上前拎了菜刀就走了出去。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－新文求收，求评，哈哈~！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongfuchengyin-nongjiatongyangxi/2.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 2 Robbery of Food Su Xiaomo leaned weakly against the door, frowning at the two women in the courtyard. When she first walked out, she heard some of their conversation. It seemed that they were here to collect debts. In Su Xiaofan's memory, her mother had always been frail and sick, and she had been taking medicine all year round, so her family owed money to many people in the village. When her mother finally recovered from her illness and became pregnant with the child, her father suddenly passed away, so that when he was buried, he borrowed a lot of money from his second uncle and his third uncle's family. \"Fan'er, why are you up? Go in and have a rest.\" Jia strode over and gestured to help her back to the room. \"Mom, I'm much better, but you, is it okay to walk so fast?\" Although she had just eaten a bowl of porridge, Su Xiaomo still felt light all over, and she felt like she was stepping on clouds when she walked. And when she walked out and saw the poor courtyard, the uneven ground, and the few scattered households in the distance, Su Xiaomo felt like she had traveled through time. From now on, she would live as Su Xiaofan and protect her family for Su Xiaofan. \"Mother, I'm used to it. You have just recovered from a serious illness, so you need to take a good rest.\" Jia Shi smiled lightly, feeling happy in her heart. Fan'er became more caring about others since she woke up. Just as Su Xiaofan was about to speak, Mrs. Li who was not far away yelled again: \"Mom, look at Xiaofan, he is already alive and kicking. Why do you need money for medical treatment? Ask your sister-in-law to pay us back some first.\" Mrs. Meng agreed at the side. Said: \"Yes, mother, the second sister-in-law is right.\" Madam Ye glared at her angrily: \"Which of your eyes saw us Fan'er jumping around? Look at that pale face, you all want to take away the little money that saved your life. \" When Meng saw this, she was not angry. She seemed to have been used to Ye's anger, and said sarcastically: \"Xiaofan has been disowned by the Zhang family. I'm afraid no one will marry her in the future. My eldest brother is really unlucky to marry such a person. My daughter-in-law gave birth to a money-losing girl. I wonder if my sister-in-law is pregnant with another money-losing girl. \"You...get out of here.\" Mrs. Ye was angry and picked up the broom beside her, trying to drive people away. \"You give us the money, and we'll leave. Who wants to come all the way to this shabby place like yours?\" Ms. Li was convinced that the old woman didn't dare to hit herself. She stood there without moving at all. She even looked around with a look of disgust and continued, \"I don't even know. How can you live in this shabby house with strong winds that can blow the bed for so many years? \"You are evil, second husband, what evil did the third husband do in your previous life to marry such a vicious wife like you?\" Mrs. Ye was shaking with anger as she held the broom in her hand. \"Mom, you are really stupid. Back then, you still asked the matchmaker to come to our house to propose marriage.\" Meng covered her mouth and laughed. People say that when you get older, you will forget things, and that's true. \"Eh...\" Mrs. Ye beat her chest and felt regretful. If she hadn't married such two daughters-in-law back then, how could Yifu and Zhiyan's life have been like this. Seeing this, Mrs. Jia walked over, supported her, and said with worry on her face: \"Mom, don't get so angry.\" Then she glanced at the two of them reproachfully and said, \"You two brothers and sisters, you should be careful in your words. Mom is old and her health is not good.\" Meng said proudly. With a thin eyebrow, he retorted loudly: \"If sister-in-law had been more willing to take out the money, would we still be making trouble here?\" \"What's going on, I haven't seen you come back for a long time?\" Following a thick voice, a group of people walked slowly and slowly on the path not far away. Su Xiaofan raised her eyes and looked over. The people coming were her second uncle, third uncle, two sons from the second uncle's family, and a son and a daughter from the third uncle's family. Su Xiaofan frowned unconsciously when he saw the visitor. According to his memory, these people were not considered good people. \"Dad, you're here. Look, this mother and sister-in-law refuse to pay back the money.\" Meng saw her man coming, and the moment they stepped into the yard, she raised her feet to greet him. \"Mom, this is your fault. You must have agreed when we borrowed the money before.\" After Su Sanfu walked into the yard, he glanced at his elderly mother complainingly, and then at Su Xiaofan who was standing at the door, and continued: \"Sister-in-law, you see Xiaofan has woken up well.\" \"Third brother, it's not that my mother and I didn't give it, it's actually the fact that the Zhang family didn't give much silver. Fan'er has been here to grab medicine these days. I removed some, and today my mother went to buy some rice, cornmeal, etc., and there is no money left.\" Mrs. Jia looked embarrassed. In the past, the husband came to deal with the debt collectors and never let her deal with them. But after the husband died, the creditors saw that the life of the orphan and widow was not easy, and they rarely came to ask for money. The only people who came frequently were the second brother and the third brother's family. At this time, a thin young man who had been standing behind Su Sanfu stood up and shouted loudly: \"Father, mother, I think we can just take away the things they bought. It seems that we can't get any money today.\" Then a young man behind Su Erfu also stood up and said: \"Siqing is right.\" \"Then let's do it.\" Su Erfu said in a low voice, with a hint of displeasure in his rough voice. After he finished speaking, the two teenagers walked into a small side room and took out the bag of things that Ye had bought this morning. \"You can't do this, that's the only food in this family.\" Ye was so anxious that she almost cried. Without that food, how could the child Fan'er get better? Besides, Zhiyan was about to give birth. \"Mom, please don't make trouble unreasonably. Paying back debts is a matter of course.\" Su Erfu stared at his mother in a deep voice, as if he was disgusted by her appearance at the moment. \"God, what evil have I done?\" Ye", "title_en": "Chapter 2"}